# MeetingAI Notetaker

Tagline: Focus on the call, we'll take the notes.

An AI assistant that joins your Zoom and Teams calls to write summaries.

Stop scrambling to take notes while you're trying to listen. MeetingAI joins your video calls, listens in, and writes a clear summary with action items and deadlines. It can even push those tasks directly to your team's to-do list so nothing gets missed.

Key features:
- Multi-Platform: Zoom, Teams, Meet. Works everywhere.
- Speaker ID: Knows who said what. Clarity.
- Action Items: Auto-detects tasks. Accountability.
- Searchable: Find keywords. Easy recall.

Benefits:
- Productive Meetings
- Accurate Records
- Time Savings
- Better Follow-up

FAQs:

Q: Does it record everything?
A: It only joins meetings you invite it to. You can stop or delete recordings at any time.

Q: Does it work with Zoom?
A: Yes, it works natively with Zoom, Microsoft Teams, Google Meet, and Webex.

Q: Does it understand accents?
A: Our AI model is trained on global accents and handles "Spanglish" or "Hinglish" beautifully.

Q: Is the summary reliable?
A: The AI reaches 90%+ accuracy in capturing key facts and action items.

Q: Does the bot show on the screen?
A: Yes, it appears as a participant (e.g., "[Your Name]'s Assistant") to ensure transparency.

Q: Can I search past meetings?
A: Yes, all meetings are searchable by keyword. "What did we decide on the budget in July?".

Q: Can I edit the notes?
A: Yes, you can edit the generated summary before sharing the final version with the team.

Q: How long are recordings kept?
A: Recordings are kept forever on our Pro plan, or for 30 days on our Basic plan.

Q: What does the "Multi-Platform" capability include?
A: Zoom, Teams, Meet. The benefit: works everywhere.

Q: What does the "Speaker ID" capability include?
A: Knows who said what. The benefit: clarity.